&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWVcT_edKC-MFFUa67hHskHZZBsYXMU8Ey441GWF6mbnQ&oe=6B105C7E"}, {"file_name": "04-weiher-daube.png", "id": "1432051659095433", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1432051662428766_5426025852920330733_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nmsalW3AIw0Q7kNvwHVEJi2&_nc_oc=AdqSbCXDeZVTsYuhFPKzKZ5tJgjy6UPya6SlzsyPV6Tjyjqx09jLaEgpgacI5wNPyk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV-QxLnGA-v9eZuCuO7BFYHmIWA2JCrGZVfARNQ6cpOiA&oe=6B105268"}, {"file_name": "06-see-gegner-bank.png", "id": "1849823072696645", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1849823076029978_3621794476345053952_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1cyRw8XCaFQQ7kNvwHNGMFy&_nc_oc=AdraFeS0TUgl7EeEyqYjijooxGrcKNQiDnAGKIpw3kO3btOiRxuuz4TxzKmR82lYIlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXyfmd8Y7Ellr7PQzBhG56Zr87EIiAuFu5GVsA4wwvLOA&oe=6B1069F7"}, {"file_name": "07-ueberschlag.png", "id": "1454089702849140", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1454089706182473_7118370578619682634_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OTliIx6uoFgQ7kNvwGkzc33&_nc_oc=Ado5h3OVVOURZNL1GodL55SkR74JJZruxhmuaVbfHcrk7KQBokGVZSm6Kg-r9316BO4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXDRsdubPBBHQ2nTrh7tFEymZL0kThyumb-Ta-ZvxWdQg&oe=6B104CC6"}, {"file_name": "12-spielende.png", "id": "1810349796698469", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1810349800031802_6108440788740542174_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hW2smeiHUj0Q7kNvwH5lyNt&_nc_oc=AdoCvYNdqb9m0PSBDXuvH4X7MICKA7vvSy3yU6LHAbHkBxd7a5BP-joAfj6Y9aeO35k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXHBrlyi2Jlm18_nyjl4wE-CM15HG8PUK-Hc5ggGqurWg&oe=6B10454B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "10-weiher-treffer.png", "id": "40447757921475987", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_40447757958142650_8924985145149316890_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EKLi-hfeBYoQ7kNvwF6uYkh&_nc_oc=Adp0FNb9NI5P5dppxo8B_Mtza7DcTwiRFuSmMcrZbb8P97SKPUaB9OERZtHGPEDBlxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWIo8K1XOJ50uUl21_iTXzQlpUCMsIAU9134MWjTiTVXw&oe=6B104D5F"}, "display_name": "Eisstock Challenge", "keywords": ["curling", "multiplayer", "eisstock", "wintersports", "icestock"], "long_description": "There's that one moment just before you let go: your arm swings from the shoulder, the stock pulls forward, and you can already feel whether it's a good one. Eisstockschiessen is the Alpine cousin of curling, and in Eisstock Challenge you throw with your own arm. No power bar, no aiming arrow \u2013 just you, the ice and the Daube, the small wooden target 25 metres away.\n\nAt the village pond you play in front of the church, the maypole and the inn, with fairy lights strung above the lane. On the mountain lake, dusk settles over the peaks, torches line the shore, the fire basket crackles and somewhere an owl calls. In the ice stock hall, light pours through tall panoramic windows and the stands cheer when your shot lands.\n\nEvery stock slides, spins, wobbles and collides exactly the way you threw it. A clean shot clears your rival out of the target area, a gentle throw nestles up to the Daube, and sometimes a single stock turns the whole round on its head.\n\nPlay against the computer, pass the headset around among friends or challenge someone online. Never thrown a stock before? The introduction shows you how in three minutes, and in training you can hone your throw.\n\nPlayed standing, with just enough room to swing your arm. In English and German.", "short_description": "The church tower and maypole behind you, 25 metres of gleaming ice ahead. Swing, let go and listen to your stock hiss across the ice until it comes to rest by the Daube \u2013 or knocks your rival's stock out of play with a satisfying clack. Bavarian ice stock sport in VR: at the village pond, on a mountain lake at dusk and in the hall in front of a cheering crowd."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "957566247148568", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Eisstock Challenge", "keywords": ["eisstock", "eisstockschiessen", "curling", "wintersport", "mehrspieler"], "long_description": "Es gibt diesen einen Moment, kurz bevor du losl\u00e4sst: Der Arm schwingt aus der Schulter, der Stock zieht nach vorn, und du sp\u00fcrst schon, ob er gut wird. In Eisstock Challenge wirfst du mit deinem eigenen Arm. Kein Kraftbalken, kein Zielpfeil \u2013 nur du, das Eis und die Daube, 25 Meter vor dir.\n\nAm Dorfweiher spielst du vor Kirche, Maibaum und Wirtshaus, \u00fcber der Bahn leuchten Lichterketten. Am Bergsee senkt sich die D\u00e4mmerung \u00fcber die Gipfel, Fackeln s\u00e4umen das Ufer, im Feuerkorb knistert es, und irgendwo ruft eine Eule. In der Stockhalle f\u00e4llt das Licht durch gro\u00dfe Panoramafenster, und die Trib\u00fcne jubelt, wenn dein Schuss sitzt.\n\nJeder Stock gleitet, dreht sich, wackelt und prallt genau so, wie du ihn geworfen hast. Ein sauberer Schuss r\u00e4umt den Gegner aus dem Feld, ein gef\u00fchlvoller Wurf schmiegt sich an die Daube, und manchmal dreht ein einziger Stock die ganze Kehre.\n\nSpiel gegen den Computer, gib die Brille an deine Freunde weiter oder fordere jemanden online heraus. Noch nie einen Stock geworfen? Die Einf\u00fchrung zeigt dir in drei Minuten, wie es geht, und im Training feilst du an deinem Wurf.\n\nGespielt wird im Stehen, ein wenig Platz zum Ausholen gen\u00fcgt. Auf Deutsch und Englisch.", "short_description": "Kirchturm und Maibaum im R\u00fccken, vor dir 25 Meter blankes Eis. Hol aus, lass los und h\u00f6r zu, wie dein Stock \u00fcbers Eis rauscht, bis er an der Daube liegen bleibt \u2013 oder den Stock deines Gegners mit einem satten Klack aus dem Feld schie\u00dft. Eisstockschie\u00dfen in VR: am Dorfweiher, am Bergsee in der Abendd\u00e4mmerung und in der Halle vor jubelndem Publikum."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://franciscodurand.de/eisstock-challenge/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Durand y B\u00f6ning", "support_website_url": "https://franciscodurand.de/eisstock-challenge/#contact", "website_url": "https://franciscodurand.de/eisstock-challenge/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "30143469351908842"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1177206174704814"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1177206174704814"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795524060, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1177206174704814"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "30294893986766377", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "1156179606829549", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary"